1
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:35,490
The rules keep changing.

2
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:44,330
I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.

3
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:54,770
Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.

4
00:00:57,680 --> 00:01:03,410
I am resolved to sever this flood

5
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:09,770
so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,

6
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:14,130
from loneliness and distinction.

7
00:01:14,360 --> 00:01:19,090
One more step and you'll fall into madness.

8
00:01:19,040 --> 00:01:24,090
Don't fall down.

9
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:27,290
I look towards the top.

10
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:29,930
Chase !

11
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:33,130
Refined to perfection.

12
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:39,050
Never retreat, no matter the danger.

13
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:42,090
I dare to defy the heavens !

14
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:45,930
Always overcome the obstacles,

15
00:01:45,870 --> 00:01:48,290
ignite the seas with blood,

16
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:52,730
bloom through trials and tribulations.

17
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:57,370
Even the sharpest thorns

18
00:01:57,240 --> 00:02:01,930
will be reduced into ashes.

19
00:02:01,720 --> 00:02:06,250
What is there to fear ?

20
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:15,410
Renegade Immortal
