21
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:31,200
Xu Mu ?

22
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:34,040
I'll remember this name.

23
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:38,920
Named Xu ?

24
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,840
You also thought of it...

25
00:03:42,320 --> 00:03:44,560
For such a powerful Corporeal Yang cultivator to appear,

26
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:47,040
it has to be the Xu Family of Planet Dong Lin.

27
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:49,200
Could this person be...

28
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:52,920
He is very strong.

29
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:55,640
Even if he isn't a descendant of Planet Dong Lin,

30
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:58,000
our Tang Family should avoid provoking him.

31
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,400
But Uncle Ping and the others...

32
00:04:00,760 --> 00:04:02,800
They acted recklessly.

33
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:05,610
Since they're dead, they're dead.

34
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,480
Understood.

35
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:15,970
Inside the Celestial Cave

36
00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:14,120
Brother Xu,

37
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:17,160
this cave seems somewhat peculiar.

38
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,440
Look,

39
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:21,200
on the walls around us,

40
00:04:21,280 --> 00:04:23,690
there are traces of celestial spiritual energy fluctuations.

41
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:26,480
It must have been isolated from the outside for very long.

42
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:30,240
Since this place was left by Celestials,

43
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,880
it's strange that no one visited it

44
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:34,440
before us.

45
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:44,480
We have been moving at full speed

46
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:46,360
for half an hour now.

47
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:48,280
Why haven't we reached the end yet ?

48
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:51,400
Just how deep is this tunnel ?

49
00:04:52,960 --> 00:04:54,400
Something's wrong.

50
00:04:58,880 --> 00:04:59,600
Brother Xu,

51
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,320
what is it ?

52
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:02,680
Do you sense anything unusual ?

53
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,640
What do you mean, Brother Xu ?

54
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:06,760
Since we entered,

55
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:09,160
I have been using my Divine Sense to probe the path ahead

56
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:10,600
and mark our way back.

57
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:12,760
But I discovered

58
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:15,280
that the tunnel we are in

59
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:17,640
is a rune.

60
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,520
Brother Li,

61
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:22,960
do you recognize this rune ?

62
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:26,440
This rune is a type of celestial restriction.

63
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:27,560
It's extremely rare

64
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,200
and can't be used by itself.

65
00:05:29,440 --> 00:05:32,040
It needs to be combined with other runes

66
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:34,000
to form a restriction formation.

67
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:37,080
So complex...

68
00:05:37,320 --> 00:05:39,840
Can you tell what kind of formation it is ?

69
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:45,560
Not yet.

70
00:05:45,880 --> 00:05:47,440
We have too little information

71
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,760
to make a guess.

72
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:50,960
Before we reach the end,

73
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:53,000
it will be impossible to determine

74
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,960
what formation it is.

75
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:57,800
The Celestial Realm has been shattered for so long

76
00:05:57,840 --> 00:06:00,200
but this place still has an active formation ?

77
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:02,440
Whatever is at the end

78
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:04,150
is either a great treasure

79
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:05,960
or a great calamity.

80
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:08,640
But this is too rare of an opportunity...

81
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:10,840
Giving up now

82
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:12,680
would be a waste.

83
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:15,440
Brother Li,

84
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:17,120
in that case,

85
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:18,760
let's go down and see.

86
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:20,760
But remember, we must act cautiously

87
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:22,320
and understand the formation

88
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,640
before deciding.

89
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:29,810
30 minutes later

90
00:06:27,280 --> 00:06:28,720
The end is just ahead !

91
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:48,320
Brother Xu,

92
00:06:48,520 --> 00:06:49,560
I figured it out.

93
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:51,440
This formation of runes

94
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:52,480
has only a single function.

95
00:06:52,440 --> 00:06:53,680
It's for healing.

96
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:55,720
If I'm not mistaken,

97
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:58,640
there are 9 such runic tunnels in total.

98
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:00,890
The 9 runes work together

99
00:07:00,640 --> 00:07:02,800
to create a massive healing formation.

100
00:07:03,400 --> 00:07:04,880
All this time,

101
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,400
it never stopped operating.

102
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:08,960
Brother Li, do you mean that

103
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:10,520
all this time,

104
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:13,240
someone has been healing within

105
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,520
this formation ?

106
00:07:14,880 --> 00:07:16,360
In the Thunder Celestial Realm,

107
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:18,360
someone who could use so many resources

108
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:19,800
just for healing

109
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:22,000
must be...

110
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,600
a Celestial !

111
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:27,850
The Celestial healing in this formation has already awakened.

112
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:30,360
He most likely sensed our presence long ago

113
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:32,920
and allowed us to venture this deep.

114
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:37,000
It's just a mere restriction.

115
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:38,890
I'm confident I can open it for you, Brother Xu.

116
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:44,940
Li Yuan !

117
00:07:45,200 --> 00:07:46,160
What's wrong ?

118
00:07:46,260 --> 00:07:47,160
Brother Xu,

119
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:48,880
don't you want to learn celestial spells ?

120
00:07:49,080 --> 00:07:51,280
If we can find this Celestial,

121
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:52,800
we will obtain

122
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:54,120
countless celestial spells !

123
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:55,960
Brother Xu, let go of me !

124
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,880
I will open the restriction

125
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:58,290
Li Yuan isn't this reckless usually.

126
00:07:57,640 --> 00:07:59,280
to get the celestial spells !

127
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:00,560
Let go of me !

128
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:01,120
Could it be...?

129
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:11,080
Li Yuan must have been bewitched

130
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:11,960
by someone.

131
00:08:12,280 --> 00:08:14,400
What exactly is in there ?

132
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:18,640
You...

133
00:08:18,840 --> 00:08:20,920
What celestial spell do you wish to learn ?

134
00:08:22,520 --> 00:08:24,320
Have your friend

135
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,600
cast those celestial restrictions

136
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:29,680
and I will grant all your desires.

137
00:08:29,640 --> 00:08:30,760
Who are you ?

138
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,400
Do you want to learn

139
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:36,200
or not ?

140
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:39,680
Countless cultivators chase after celestial spells

141
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:42,000
and this person offers them so easily ?

142
00:08:42,280 --> 00:08:43,890
There must be something wrong.

143
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:46,360
No matter how precious the celestial spell,

144
00:08:46,400 --> 00:08:48,440
I will only cultivate the ones

145
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:49,560
I obtain by myself.

146
00:08:50,680 --> 00:08:52,400
I must never repeat the mistake

147
00:08:52,880 --> 00:08:54,440
of the Celestial Slaughter Art.

148
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:59,600
I hate cautious people !

149
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,080
This is...

150
00:09:13,040 --> 00:09:14,960
I acted impulsively just now.

151
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:16,400
I held you back...

152
00:09:16,160 --> 00:09:17,560
It's not your fault.

153
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:19,600
That power was too strange.

154
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:21,730
We need to quickly leave this place.

155
00:09:25,800 --> 00:09:26,800
What's this !?

156
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:29,160
Ji Realm !?

157
00:09:32,040 --> 00:09:32,840
Brother Li,

158
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:33,560
hurry up !

159
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:44,600
Brother Xu,

160
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,120
quick !

161
00:09:56,920 --> 00:10:00,330
Wasteland
Thunder Celestial Realm

162
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:02,480
Brother Xu !

163
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:13,120
Brother Li,

164
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:14,080
protect me !

165
00:10:17,920 --> 00:10:20,000
I've never seen Brother Xu look so serious.

166
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:22,530
What exactly was that crimson light ?

167
00:10:22,280 --> 00:10:25,490
Wang Lin's Sea of Consciousness

168
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:45,080
The power of this Ji Realm is truly astonishing.

169
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:48,210
If I hadn't once possessed the Ji Realm myself,

170
00:10:48,040 --> 00:10:50,210
and known how to counter it with origin energy,

171
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:52,360
then even with my Corporeal Yang's cultivation,

172
00:10:52,760 --> 00:10:55,160
my Origin Soul would have been destroyed by it !

173
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:04,320
Celestial spells...

174
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:05,760
Celestial spells !

175
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:18,690
Not enough !

176
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:19,800
It's still not enough !

177
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:22,520
I need more Qi Refiners !

178
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:25,480
Only 4 seals remain !

179
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:27,520
Qing Shui...

180
00:11:27,560 --> 00:11:29,400
The day you will die

181
00:11:29,800 --> 00:11:31,330
is approaching !

182
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:43,320
I finally sealed it...

183
00:11:44,160 --> 00:11:46,000
Who exactly is sealed

184
00:11:46,280 --> 00:11:47,560
behind that vortex ?

185
00:11:48,280 --> 00:11:50,400
To be able to control such a Ji Realm...

186
00:11:52,280 --> 00:11:53,840
Ji Realm cultivators

187
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:55,280
can't breakthrough above Nascent Soul.

188
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:57,960
The only exception

189
00:11:57,800 --> 00:11:59,480
was when I met Na Duo.

190
00:12:00,040 --> 00:12:02,680
But that was because his Ji Realm was gifted by a friend,

191
00:12:02,920 --> 00:12:04,600
not cultivated from scratch.

192
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,240
Could it be...

193
00:12:06,640 --> 00:12:08,120
that there is a way

194
00:12:08,400 --> 00:12:10,730
to continue cultivating with the Ji Realm ?

195
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:16,210
Brother Xu,

196
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,400
how are your injuries ?

197
00:12:17,640 --> 00:12:18,520
I'm fine.

198
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:20,840
It would be a pity

199
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:22,280
to just destroy it...

200
00:12:22,560 --> 00:12:24,360
I'd rather sacrifice some origin energy

201
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:25,920
to keep it.

202
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:27,320
It may become useful.

203
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:29,600
Let's go.

204
00:12:29,760 --> 00:12:31,440
We need to find the Collection Pavilion.

205
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:40,170
a month and a half later

206
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:42,490
Void
Thunder Celestial Realm

207
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:43,440
There are too many cultivators suddenly gathering...

208
00:12:43,800 --> 00:12:45,040
Something is wrong.

209
00:12:45,520 --> 00:12:47,040
Their destinations vary...

210
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:49,560
They're going in all 4 directions.

211
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:52,280
What happened exactly ?

212
00:13:03,680 --> 00:13:04,840
It's Zhan Konglie !

213
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:06,160
Apparently,

214
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:08,520
he has become a Thunder Celestial Messenger.

215
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:11,480
Zhan Konglie !

216
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:16,120
with Shengong Hu and Tang Yanfeng, they are the 3 Heroes of the Southern Domain.

217
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:18,240
All 3 are prodigies of their generation.

218
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:21,400
They all reached Corporeal Yang at a young age.

219
00:13:21,640 --> 00:13:23,320
They have a lot of potential.

220
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:33,520
Stop there !

221
00:14:02,880 --> 00:14:04,080
Junior Zhan Konglie,

222
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:05,120
pays respect to Senior.

223
00:14:05,680 --> 00:14:06,800
Senior !?

224
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:09,600
But this guy's cultivation is the same as Zhan Konglie's...

225
00:14:10,040 --> 00:14:11,280
Corporeal Yang ?

226
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:12,920
So he really is a Senior.

227
00:14:13,080 --> 00:14:15,560
I couldn't see him hiding his cultivation before,

228
00:14:15,560 --> 00:14:17,240
and it's the same now.

229
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:19,480
Where are you going

230
00:14:19,760 --> 00:14:20,920
in such haste ?

231
00:14:21,040 --> 00:14:22,040
Senior,

232
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:24,360
4 fragments of the Thunder Celestial Realm suddenly gave off

233
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:26,290
powerful celestial spiritual energy fluctuations.

234
00:14:26,640 --> 00:14:28,080
It's all sealed by restrictions

235
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:29,890
but we suspect great treasures will appear.

236
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:31,880
Junior has already agreed with Brother Shengong

237
00:14:31,760 --> 00:14:32,960
to join forces.

238
00:14:33,360 --> 00:14:34,200
Does Senior

239
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:35,600
have the time

240
00:14:35,920 --> 00:14:37,560
to accompany me ?

241
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:39,640
I have other matters.

242
00:14:40,040 --> 00:14:41,520
This journey sounds dangerous,

243
00:14:41,680 --> 00:14:42,880
be careful.

244
00:14:45,920 --> 00:14:46,720
Understood !

245
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:47,800
Junior will remember !

246
00:14:48,640 --> 00:14:52,050
Central fragment
Thunder Celestial Realm

247
00:14:58,240 --> 00:15:00,440
The Collection Pavilion should be right here.

248
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:03,160
There are indeed restriction fluctuations here

249
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:04,760
that are similar to celestial restrictions.

250
00:15:05,520 --> 00:15:07,000
Although they are faint,

251
00:15:08,040 --> 00:15:09,680
I can detect something

252
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:11,320
with my Restriction Heart.

253
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:36,480
Brother Xu,

254
00:15:36,760 --> 00:15:38,120
I will need some time.

255
00:15:54,280 --> 00:15:55,240
Brother Xu,

256
00:15:55,520 --> 00:15:57,760
breaking this restriction completely

257
00:15:58,040 --> 00:15:59,520
will likely take months.

258
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:01,240
With your restrictions

259
00:16:01,680 --> 00:16:02,960
and my speed,

260
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:04,640
sending me inside

261
00:16:04,760 --> 00:16:05,920
should be feasible.

262
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:07,600
Good idea !

263
00:16:07,880 --> 00:16:09,050
It's worth a try.

264
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:12,320
Brother Li,

265
00:16:12,680 --> 00:16:13,680
once I'm inside,

266
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:14,880
find a place to hide.

267
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:16,770
After I obtain the celestial spells,

268
00:16:16,680 --> 00:16:17,920
we will leave together.

269
00:16:25,880 --> 00:16:27,800
Restriction Heart, burst !

270
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:40,690
Colletion Pavilion
Thunder Celestial Realm

271
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:47,330
Forbidden ground guardian
Yao Family cultivator
Corporeal Yang

272
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:50,320
Outsiders of the four great families

273
00:16:50,320 --> 00:16:52,120
who trespass into this forbidden ground

274
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:52,880
must die !

275
00:16:57,520 --> 00:16:59,360
This is the Thunder Celestial Realm,

276
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:01,760
the Collection Pavilion is a relic of the past.

277
00:17:02,560 --> 00:17:04,920
Why can the four great families use it freely

278
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:06,360
but not me ?

279
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:07,840
Because

280
00:17:08,040 --> 00:17:09,680
you're not qualified.

281
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:51,130
And Origin Soul that devours thunder !?

282
00:18:19,520 --> 00:18:21,160
Do you intend to keep watching !?

283
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:22,570
Forbidden ground guardian
Chen Family cultivator
Corporeal Yang

284
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:22,570
Forbidden ground guardian
Lu Family cultivator
Corporeal Yang

285
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:22,570
Forbidden ground guardian
Song Family cultivator
Corporeal Yang

286
00:18:22,560 --> 00:18:23,760
Let me pass,

287
00:18:24,160 --> 00:18:25,440
and we can avoid this fight.

